%% ============================================
%% FRONTISPIECE — "全書一句話" spread built on Ruth's own vow of
%% loyalty (1:16), the same role Job 42:5-6, Acts 1:8 and Isaiah 12:2-3
%% play in the sister volumes.
%% ============================================
\thispagestyle{empty}
\begin{center}
\vspace*{0.3in}

\begin{tikzpicture}
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (-2.8,0) -- (-0.55,0);
  \fill[ScriptureGold] (0,0) circle (0.055);
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (0.55,0) -- (2.8,0);
\end{tikzpicture}

\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{FieldAmber} 全書一句話 \textperiodcentered\ The Whole Book in One Verse}

\vspace{0.30cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{CommentaryBrown}
不要催我回去不跟隨你！你往哪裏去，我也往哪裏去；\\
你在哪裏住宿，我也在哪裏住宿。\textbf{\color{DawnRose!80!black}你的國就是我的國}，\\
\textbf{\color{DawnRose!80!black}你的神就是我的神}。\\[0.5em]
\footnotesize\itshape
Do not urge me to leave you or turn back from following you;\\
for where you go, I will go, and where you lodge, I will lodge.\\
\textbf{Your people shall be my people}, and \textbf{your God, my God}.\\[0.4em]
\small\color{FieldAmber} 路得記 1:16 \textperiodcentered\ Ruth 1:16
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 四章 \textperiodcentered\ 四卷 \textperiodcentered\ 一句對婆婆、對神的委身之言\\
\textit{Four chapters \textperiodcentered\ four volumes \textperiodcentered\ one vow of committed loyalty}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{3.3cm}p{2.0cm}p{6.8cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{卷別} & \textbf{章別} & \textbf{在全書的展開} \\
\midrule
卷一 \textperiodcentered\ 空 (Emptied) & 第1章 & 饑荒逼遷摩押，丈夫兒子相繼離世——拿俄米空手空心歸回伯利恆 \\
卷二 \textperiodcentered\ 遇 (Encountered) & 第2章 & 路得下田拾穗，「恰巧」來到波阿斯的田——至近的親屬第一次被看見 \\
卷三 \textperiodcentered\ 求 (Sought) & 第3章 & 拿俄米定計，路得夜叩禾場，求波阿斯用衣襟遮蓋——正式求贖 \\
卷四 \textperiodcentered\ 滿 (Filled) & 第4章 & 波阿斯城門前贖回產業與路得，孩子出生，家譜直通大衛 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{FieldAmber} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
不是來讀一則異邦女子的溫情小故事，是來看神如何在士師秉政、人人任意而行的黑暗年代裡，
藉一個外邦寡婦的忠誠，靜靜編織祂救贖的家譜。\\
若你讀完四章卻只記得「路得很孝順」——請從頭再讀，\\
這次留意：全書沒有一次神蹟、沒有一句先知的話，神卻始終在饑荒、拾穗、禾場與城門的每一步裡。\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
You are not reading a sentimental tale of a devoted daughter-in-law — you are
watching God quietly weave His redemptive genealogy through the loyalty of a
foreign widow, in the very days when everyone did what was right in their own
eyes.\\
If after four chapters you remember only "Ruth was loyal," read it again.\\
This time notice: not one miracle, not one word from a prophet — yet God is
present in every step, from famine to gleaning field to threshing floor to the
city gate.}
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.3in}
\end{center}
\cleardoublepage

